From 5e4ccb1881a3fa6d218ec051db0abd38c7580388 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:06:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: add a contrast autofocus

Sweep the lens in coarse steps, stopping once past the peak, then in
fine steps around the best position, and park it there. A lasting change
of the contrast followed by a steady scene starts a new sweep. Enabled
in the uncalibrated tuning; it does nothing without a lens.

